    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Soil nutrient status is defined by appropriate levels of available macronutrients, i.e. nitrogen, phosphorus, calcium, magnesium, potassium and sulphur, and micronutrients, i.e. boron, zinc, manganese, iron, copper and molybdenum."
